1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,975
Before you test a reranker, decide
what "it helped" will mean.

2
00:00:04,983 --> 00:00:10,261
For example: ship only if end-to-end
correctness gains at least 2 points, with a

3
00:00:10,261 --> 00:00:12,833
confidence interval that excludes zero.

4
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:17,200
No important slice regresses by
more than 1 point.

5
00:00:17,817 --> 00:00:23,492
And p95 latency rises by no
more than 150 ms.

6
00:00:24,517 --> 00:00:29,517
Writing it down first stops you from
explaining away a result after the fact.

7
00:00:30,517 --> 00:00:33,142
The full article is on vidyal.ai.
